            "product_1_text": "The Addax MTN is a compact, fully electric utility vehicle built for urban logistics. With a 6m³ cargo volume, 1,000 kg payload, and a 4.5-meter turning radius, it offers exceptional versatility. Available in configurations like tipper, fridge, and flatbed, it’s the ideal solution for efficient, eco-friendly transport.",
